        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Giovanni Giarola, Gerolli\n- Places: Reggio Emilia, Emilia-Romagna, northern Italy\n- Roles: Italian painter\n- Concepts: Renaissance style\n\nFacts:\n- Giovanni Giarola, also called Gerolli, lived from 1518 to 1557.\n- Giovanni Giarola was an Italian painter of the Renaissance style.\n- Giovanni Giarola was active mainly in Reggio Emilia.\n- Reggio Emilia is a city in northern Italy in the Emilia-Romagna region.\n- Reggio Emilia is also known in Emilian as Rèz and in Latin as Regium Lepidi.",
